      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84540",
      "en": "That's not what I heard.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84541",
      "en": "And what did you hear, exactly?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84542",
      "en": "More rumors about strange metal creatures with real AI, no doubt.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84543",
      "en": "Yes, but there's more.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84544",
      "en": "There always is.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84545",
      "en": "I heard they had some connection with a rogue Spectre.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84546",
      "en": "Not this again.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84547",
      "en": "Why is that so hard to believe?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84548",
      "en": "Whatever you say. Just don't expect us to believe it, too.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84550",
      "en": "What? Everyone knows Fist is in with the local criminals.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84551",
      "en": "Maybe, but I wouldn't go shouting it from the mountaintops.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84552",
      "en": "Unless you want to end up on his hit list.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84553",
      "en": "Yeah, I heard he actually buried some corpses under the stage at Chora's Den.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84554",
      "en": "Wouldn't put it past him.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84555",
      "en": "Yeah, and it might explain the stench in that place.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84556",
      "en": "I still can't believe that could happen out in the open like that.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84557",
      "en": "Neither could he. The C-Sec agent said there's been an increase in violent crimes in this area lately.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84558",
      "en": "Did he say why?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84559",
      "en": "No, he kinda skirted the issue.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84560",
      "en": "It's those damn humans, if you ask me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84561",
      "en": "They're not all bad. They're just different, mostly.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|84562",
      "en": "I don't like 'em. They all act like they've been living here forever. The Citadel is ours.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_customers_D|113729",
      "en": "You should be careful who you say that around.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_patron01_D|84603",
      "en": "I'm waiting for someone else.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_patron01_D|84604",
      "en": "Place is busier than usual.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_patron01_D|84605",
      "en": "Hey.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_patron01_D|84606",
      "en": "Try your luck at Quasar yet?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_patron02_D|84607",
      "en": "Hey, good to see another human in here.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_patron02_D|84608",
      "en": "Not a bad place, but it's just not the same as back home.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_patron02_D|84609",
      "en": "Drinks aren't bad, but good luck finding a beer here.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_flux_patron02_D|84610",
      "en": "Having fun?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_banter_01_D|159885",
      "en": "Drinks and dancing down below, gambling up above... good place to blow off some steam.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_banter_01_D|159887",
      "en": "Aw, man! My sisters would love this place. Maybe when this is all over, I'll bring them here for a girls' night out.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_banter_01_D|159888",
      "en": "If we weren't on duty, I'd have to show you some of my dance moves... sir.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_banter_01_D|159890",
      "en": "Why is the music in these places always so loud? It almost seems as if the people here want an excuse not to talk to each other.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_banter_01_D|159892",
      "en": "You almost never see any keepers in this club. I guess they don't care what happens here. That, or the music keeps them away.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_banter_01_D|159894",
      "en": "Hmph. Places like this always want to hire krogan bouncers. It's like we're a status symbol for them.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_banter_01_D|159896",
      "en": "This music is... interesting. I wonder if I can find a copy to bring back to the flotilla?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81903",
      "en": "Welcome to Flux. Name's Doran. What can I do for you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81904",
      "en": "Owner, cook, and bartender. I've even been known to dance a little when the mood strikes me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81905",
      "en": "Enjoy your time here at Flux.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81906",
      "en": "Among other things, yes.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81910",
      "en": "Let me see that. You got that from Schells, didn't you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81912",
      "en": "I saw him using it earlier. Tossed him out on his ass for it, too. Thanks for bringing this to me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81913",
      "en": "I agree with you on that. Thanks again. Take a few shots at the quasar, on the house.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81914",
      "en": "I suppose it is. Take a few tries of quasar, on the house.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81916",
      "en": "Hello again. Can I help you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81917",
      "en": "Well, Jenna left to work at Chora's Den. Now her sister Rita is all worried she might be in some kind of trouble. ",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81919",
      "en": "Not much chance Jenna will change her mind, though. She's a stubborn one.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81925",
      "en": "Are you the owner?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81926",
      "en": "Goodbye.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81927",
      "en": "Is this a casino?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81931",
      "en": "I've got something you might be interested in.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81934",
      "en": "Cheaters shouldn't prosper.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81935",
      "en": "I think that tool should be worth something to you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81937",
      "en": "Just passing through.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81938",
      "en": "What can you tell me about the sisters working for you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81941",
      "en": "I should be going.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81947",
      "en": "You own this place?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81948",
      "en": "Nothing.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81949",
      "en": "Flux",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81953",
      "en": "[Give him Schells' tool.]",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81958",
      "en": "No problem.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81959",
      "en": "Payment.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81960",
      "en": "Nope.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81961",
      "en": "Rita and Jenna",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81964",
      "en": "Goodbye.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|89505",
      "en": "We've got some quasar stations if you're interested.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|89506",
      "en": "If she wanted to come back, I'd take her in a second. The customers loved her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|113765",
      "en": "I'm watching you. No more tricks or you'll be out on your ass too.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|77274",
      "en": "Hi! I'll be with you in just a sec.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|80508",
      "en": "I don't know what you're talking about. Now, if you don't mind I need to get back to my customers.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|80511",
      "en": "I will, thank you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|80512",
      "en": "Now you sound like my sister. Why is everyone so concerned about me? I can take care of myself.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|80513",
      "en": "I need to go. I'm not a stripper. I don't get paid to stand around and look pretty.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|80514",
      "en": "Why do I get the feeling you're not here to order drinks?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|80515",
      "en": "I'm busy. The other waitresses can help you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|80516",
      "en": "Not now. I'm busy.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|80517",
      "en": "I've got nothing to say to you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|80518",
      "en": "I need to talk to you about your work with C-Sec.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|80521",
      "en": "Have it your way.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|80522",
      "en": "This isn't a game, Jenna. These people are dangerous.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|80524",
      "en": "I'll wait right here.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|80525",
      "en": "This will be quick.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|80526",
      "en": "Make time now.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|80527",
      "en": "Okay.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|80530",
      "en": "Fine. Forget it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|80531",
      "en": "Don't be stupid.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|80534",
      "en": "Sorry.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|88505",
      "en": "Hey there. Welcome to Flux.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|88506",
      "en": "I'll be right over.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|88507",
      "en": "Take a seat. Someone will be with you soon.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|93754",
      "en": "Because I'm not.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|100094",
      "en": "Sorry, I'll get to you when I can.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|100095",
      "en": "Hi. Be with you in a minute.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|100096",
      "en": "Enjoy the entertainment. I'll get to you soon.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|104649",
      "en": "Charming girl.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|104650",
      "en": "Tough girl.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|104651",
      "en": "She puts on a brave face.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|104652",
      "en": "Stubborn girl.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|104653",
      "en": "Lovely girl.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_jenna_D|104655",
      "en": "I'm trying to help.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|77275",
      "en": "Sorry, I'm kinda busy right now. So, uh, what can I do for you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79417",
      "en": "Who, Doran? I was just asking him about my sister. She worked for Doran before she left to...",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79418",
      "en": "Sorry, I don't want to bore you with my problems.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79419",
      "en": "Well, okay. My sister Jenna left here to go work at Chora's Den.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79421",
      "en": "The problem is, she's working as an informant for C-Sec. You know, eavesdropping on the people there.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79422",
      "en": "If they find out what she's doing, they'll kill her. ",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79423",
      "en": "That's what I've been telling her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79424",
      "en": "This \"stupid mistake\" might cost her her life!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79425",
      "en": "They can't watch her all the time.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79426",
      "en": "I don't know. Sometimes I think she stays there just to spite me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79427",
      "en": "Oh. Thanks.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79428",
      "en": "Is there something you want?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79429",
      "en": "Oh, hey. Thanks for the talk earlier. I hope I didn't bore you with my stories about my sister.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79430",
      "en": "Hey, any luck with Jenna?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79431",
      "en": "Hey there. Any luck?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79432",
      "en": "I'm good, thanks.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79434",
      "en": "What were you discussing with the volus?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79436",
      "en": "I'm interested to hear what you have to say.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79440",
      "en": "Being an informant is a dangerous job.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79441",
      "en": "You can't stop her from making stupid mistakes.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79442",
      "en": "I assume C-Sec is protecting her?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79444",
      "en": "Maybe I could help her understand just how dangerous Chora's Den is.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79445",
      "en": "I won't pry. Good luck.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79446",
      "en": "Nothing.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79448",
      "en": "Problems?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79451",
      "en": "It's okay. Go on.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79452",
      "en": "I'm going.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79456",
      "en": "That's not good.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79457",
      "en": "So?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79458",
      "en": "Is she really at risk?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|79460",
      "en": "I'll speak with her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80538",
      "en": "Would you? That'd be great. Just don't tell her I sent you. ",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80539",
      "en": "Well, I should get back to work before I get in trouble. Thanks.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80541",
      "en": "No, it's all very secret.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80543",
      "en": "All right.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80544",
      "en": "Oh, no rush. I appreciate you doing this.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80545",
      "en": "Oh yeah, sure. She's over in Chora's Den waiting tables.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80546",
      "en": "That's great. I'm sorry about Jenna; she's always been like that. She won't learn until it's too late.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80555",
      "en": "I hope it works out. Goodbye.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80556",
      "en": "Do you know who her contact at C-Sec is?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80558",
      "en": "I should be going.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80559",
      "en": "I haven't spoken with her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80560",
      "en": "Can you tell me again where to find her?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80561",
      "en": "She wouldn't discuss it with me. But I think I might have a lead.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80564",
      "en": "That's okay.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80565",
      "en": "Never mind.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80566",
      "en": "Not yet.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80568",
      "en": "Where is she?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80569",
      "en": "Not really.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80579",
      "en": "Gotta go.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|80580",
      "en": "Have you talked to C-Sec?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|88440",
      "en": "Hey, Jenna came back looking for work. Thanks for getting her out of Chora's Den.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|88441",
      "en": "Yeah, everyone seems real happy to have her back.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|88442",
      "en": "You don't sound too happy.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|88443",
      "en": "I'm glad she's out of the Den. I'd just forgotten what it was like to have her around.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|88444",
      "en": "I haven't had a decent tip since she got back.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|88445",
      "en": "Rita, I've got an order for you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|88446",
      "en": "Oh, I gotta go. Thanks again for looking into this.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|88447",
      "en": "I was glad to help out.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|88453",
      "en": "I talked to her contact. We might be able to work something out.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|88454",
      "en": "No problem.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|88455",
      "en": "That's good to hear.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|88459",
      "en": "Spoke with C-Sec.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|101070",
      "en": "Commander. Thank you again for all your help.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|101071",
      "en": "Hey, Commander. Good to see you again.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|101072",
      "en": "How's it going, Commander?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|101073",
      "en": "I sense that you are less than pleased with her return.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|101074",
      "en": "You don't sound that happy about it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|101075",
      "en": "And yet, you seem less than pleased.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|101076",
      "en": "They should be. Aren't you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|101077",
      "en": "Oh, all right. Good luck, Commander.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|101083",
      "en": "I've got to get going.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|101089",
      "en": "Goodbye.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|104657",
      "en": "Last time I asked an officer he told me to stay out of it -- \"for Jenna's safety\".",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|104658",
      "en": "Really? That's fantastic. Well, I hope that goes well.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|104660",
      "en": "Get to the point.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|104662",
      "en": "Just tell me!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_rita_D|156263",
      "en": "Leave it to me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_01_rita_complains_D|79461",
      "en": "It's out of my hands, Rita. I'd bring her back in a second, but she doesn't want to come.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_01_rita_complains_D|79462",
      "en": "[sigh] I know. I know. I'll see if I can talk some sense into her next time I see her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_01_rita_complains_D|79463",
      "en": "Be careful. You know how stubborn your sister can be. The more you push and prod, the more she'll run away.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_01_rita_complains_D|79464",
      "en": "Yeah, you're probably right. Thanks, Doran.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106197",
      "en": "You ready to get the hell off this station, Commander?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106198",
      "en": "Come see me when you're ready to do this. I'll be right here waiting for you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106199",
      "en": "Hopefully, he won't be there. If he is, I'll just have to think of something.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106200",
      "en": "Udina won't let this slide, Captain. You'll be charged with treason, a capital offense.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106201",
      "en": "Udina won't let this slide, Captain. You'll be charged with treason, a capital offense.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106202",
      "en": "The ambassador will not forgive this, Captain. You will be charged with treason, a capital offense.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106203",
      "en": "The ambassador won't forgive this, Captain. You'll be charged with treason, a capital offense.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106204",
      "en": "The ambassador won't forgive this, Captain. You'll be charged with treason, a capital offense.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106205",
      "en": "We don't have a lot of options. I break into the ambassador's computer, or I take my chances with the patrols in Citadel control.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106206",
      "en": "I was hoping you'd say that. The ambassador has made this personal.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106207",
      "en": "I'll break into the ambassador's office. He made this personal.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106208",
      "en": "I'll be careful.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106209",
      "en": "I'll take care of the lockdown. You get down to the Normandy and tell Joker to stand by.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106210",
      "en": "I'm glad you came, Shepard. I heard what happened.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106211",
      "en": "I know. I'm sorry. I wanted to warn you, but there was no way to get a message to you before you docked.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106212",
      "en": "I tried. The ambassador wouldn't let me get a message through before you docked.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106213",
      "en": "I know you're pissed off right now, but you can't give up. They all think this is over, but we both know it's not.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106214",
      "en": "You have to go to Ilos. You have to stop Saren from using the Conduit!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106215",
      "en": "Citadel control's locked out all the Normandy's systems. But if we override the ambassador's orders we can get them to bring the Normandy back on-line.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106216",
      "en": "You can be in the Terminus Systems before anyone even knows you're gone.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106217",
      "en": "And if Saren finds the Conduit, life as we know it is over. The Reapers will destroy us. Humans, asari, everybody!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106218",
      "en": "You're the only one who can stop him, Shepard. So I'll do whatever it takes to get you on the Normandy and off this station.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106219",
      "en": "The Normandy's your ship now, Commander. Her crew will follow you to the ends of the galaxy. We both know that.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106220",
      "en": "I can unlock the Normandy from one of the consoles in the Citadel control center. You'll have a few minutes before anyone realizes what's happened.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106221",
      "en": "That's a restricted area patrolled by armed guards. How are you going to get in?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
