    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106226",
      "en": "Leave that to me. Just make sure you're in the Normandy when the systems come back on-line.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106227",
      "en": "Ambassador Udina issued the lockdown order. If I can hack into the computer in his office, maybe I can override it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106228",
      "en": "He's not going to let you waltz into his office and use his computer.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106229",
      "en": "He's not gonna let you waltz into his office and use his computer.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106230",
      "en": "He won't just stand by while you use his computer.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106231",
      "en": "He won't just stand by while you use his computer.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106232",
      "en": "He will not just stand by while you use his computer.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09A_DSG_LOC|sta70_captain_D|106233",
      "en": "I still have some things to take care of.",
